WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.240
What's up, everybody? My name is Machias. My dad and I own a nonprofit organization.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:10.800
He put me in charge of handling all the emails. Every single day I would

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.080
struggle for hours on end, buried in emails, trying to find important messages and organize

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:21.440
my emails, draft replies, and manage emails that I really did not need. When I

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.840
needed help the most, Kunle and his team introduced me to an AI agent that helped me.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:31.280
Their AI agent was able to flag emails for me that were important,

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:37.680
sort emails I did not need, draft replies for me, and organize my emails.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:43.680
The best thing is that it is very easy to understand and apply. At first, I thought the

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:48.720
process would be long and hard, but when they introduced it, it worked efficiently and

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.400
fast. The process was very easy to understand and apply, and I appreciate it.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:01:01.520
We are honestly bros now. If you need help with your emails,

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:07.200
I suggest you go to Kunle and his team. They can build you an AI agent to help with that

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.520
and with your personal work or your business.
